  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 20 * 60 * 40 * 20 * 10 * 0\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) +, –, ×, ÷, = \n\n20 * 60 * 40 * 20 * 10 * 0 ⇒ 20 + 60 - 40 × 20 ÷ 10 = 0\n\n⇒ 20 + 60 - 40 × __**20 **____**÷**____** 10**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 20 + 60 - __**40 **____**× 2**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**20 + 60**__ - 80 = 0\n\n⇒ __**8**____0** - 80**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 0 = 0 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) +, ×, –, ÷, =\n\n20 * 60 * 40 * 20 * 10 * 0 ⇒ 20 + 60 × 40 - 20 ÷ 10 = 0\n\n⇒ 20 + 60 × 40 - __**20 **____**÷**____** 10**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 20 + __**60 **____**×**____** 40**__ - 2 = 0\n\n⇒ __**20 + 2400**__ - 2 = 0\n\n⇒ __2420____ - **2**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 2418 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) +, ×, –, =, ÷\n\n20 * 60 * 40 * 20 * 10 * 0 ⇒ 20 + 60 × 40 - 20 = 10 ÷ 0\n\n⇒ (20 + __**60 **____**× 40**__ - 20) × 0 = 10\n\n⇒ (__**20 + **__**__2400__** - 20) × 0 = 10\n\n⇒ __**(2420**____** - 20)**__ × 0 = 10\n\n⇒ __**2400**____** × 0**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 0 ≠ 10 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷, –, ×, +, =\n\n20 * 60 * 40 * 20 * 10 * 0 ⇒ 20 ÷ 60 - 40 × 20 + 10 = 0\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 60**__ - 40 × 20 + 10 = 0\n\n⇒ 0.33 - __**40 × 20**__ + 10 = 0\n\n⇒ __**0.33 + 10**__ - 80 = 0\n\n⇒ __**1**____0.33____** - 8**____**0**__ = 0\n\n⇒ -69.67 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
